    "clos_reas": "",
    "f_activity": "Y",
    "f_comment": "The Wombat Forest 4WD Tour starts at Gisborne and takes in the scenic sites of the Wombat State Forest. Stop at Firth Park for a picnic or walk, visit the old Yankee Mine and Rat Hole Mine, drive to Mt Hope and visit the Werribee River with opportunities for picnicking and walking.Note: The 4WD grading system applies in dry conditions only. This track not suitable for inexperienced drivers in wet weather when the tracks are slippery.",
